rich_text","block_id":"XtI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd2236df-df42-4dfe-91d7-84125d89216f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"中身が転がらないようにそのままスライドさせて、縁を使って丸める","ts":"1630673665.173200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vZgDr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2bf937cb-3cdc-414c-94ec-d1aa5163c47b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"縁は火が入らないので、真ん中だけに出す\nそのあと少し置いておいてオムレツ外周を形成","ts":"1630673620.172300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W/F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a68e0ab-7612-4122-a747-ae5f2375f609","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"平たいところだけに卵を戻します","ts":"1630673566.170500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9uEA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19349160-75b1-4593-804a-0a23fc44b90b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"フライパンを軽くきれいにしたら戻すんですけど、ここがポイントで","ts":"1630673535.169700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4UT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91fa9283-1ca3-4daa-b037-2bef9b1e3a18","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"どうするかというと、まず普通に卵をわちゃわちゃやって半熟スクランブルエッグにしたあと、ボウルにあげます","ts":"1630673480.168400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DO3D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e5e427a-efa6-4c43-88b0-1e8972911b61","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"IHだと端から火が入らないのも難しいポイント","ts":"1630673363.166800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U011FTGJ3SN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pd5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4288b432-f563-4751-aa1e-fc498d3f2c96","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"その時は縁の反り上がりが丸いフライパンでやっていたので丸めるのがなかなか難しかった","ts":"1630673316.166000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uyfy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f0eea47-53e6-4c8e-a292-235162138a25","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"引っ越す前はIHだったんですがオムライス形成を確立させるまでになかなか試行錯誤が必要だった","ts":"1630673241.164600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zQ9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"365b9c9b-3370-4192-9e1e-09b041804bde","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"包む系オムライスの話かな","ts":"1630672997.163200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UDiXA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09B417B4-7663-4A8F-98D2-6EA85B4DF794","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"むしろ卵をチキンライスで覆えば良いのでは？","ts":"1630672844.162100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fukaikousatsu","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U011FTGJ3SN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bNH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d11bcccf-5ea4-4aa9-9591-8b7d47c31ff7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"切るとふわっとした部分が出てくるやつ好き","ts":"1630672837.161800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U011FTGJ3SN","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ME16k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"050EDE9E-BA09-4BE1-A72A-4F117AA9E021","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"すんません、内定出たのでめちゃくちゃ久しぶりにビール飲んで無茶苦茶に酔っ払ってます","ts":"1630672829.161400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":3,"users":["U01D9BALEKU","UAZ33BKV2","U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"tada","count":2,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cT9UQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E37F0D1E-DF74-4D04-A58C-0C9EFF03236E","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"世の中外側がトロフワで写真写りが重視されてるオムライスが多いんですけれども、オムライスの美味しいポイントは卵部分とチキンライス部分の一体感だと思うんで